@@ -0,0 +1,3 @@
+# Custom runtime
+
+`createOrderTriageAgent` receives a runtime-owned asynchronous loader and uses it to load the canonical order-triage instruction from `/moldea/agents/order-triage/instruction.md`. The factory returns the `order-triage` agent with `action` set to `classify-for-human-review` and `canApproveRefunds` set to `false`.
